      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "title": "Verify lock contention",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "S3 lock-file locking is opt-in: enable it with use_lockfile = true. Two authorized operations must not change shared state concurrently.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f1"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb1",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb2"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Use the supplied s3:GetObject, s3:PutObject and s3:DeleteObject permissions on the .tflock object. While the controlled state-changing operation holds the lock, attempt the competing operation. Verify it cannot acquire the lock or change state; do not disable locking to bypass contention.",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f2",
              "terraform.state_locking#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb3"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Locking coordinates concurrent state writers. It does not protect against identities authorized to change state objects directly.",
          "role": "mental_model",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f4"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb3"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
