      ],
      "title": "Review: verify lock contention",
      "eyebrow": "Try the contrast",
      "required": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Locking coordinates concurrent state writers; it is not an authorization boundary against identities that can directly change state objects.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f4"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb3",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb4",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb5"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Contrast competing authorized operations with direct state-object access. A lock coordinates the former; it is not an authorization boundary for identities able to change state objects directly.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f4"
