    {
      "step_id": "aws_devops.tile.122.r03",
      "type": "remediation",
      "concept_ids": [
        "terraform.state_locking"
      ],
      "title": "Review: verify lock contention",
      "eyebrow": "Try the contrast",
      "required": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The S3 backend supports lock-file locking when use_lockfile = true; locking is opt-in. Set use_lockfile = true in the supplied S3 backend configuration and use the supplied s3:GetObject, s3:PutObject and s3:DeleteObject permissions on the .tflock object. During the controlled state-changing operation that holds the lock, attempt a competing operation and verify it cannot acquire the lock or change state; do not disable locking to bypass the test.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#f1",
              "terraform.state_locking#f2",
              "terraform.state_locking#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb2",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb3",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb4",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb5",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb6"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Force-unlock is not a safe way to bypass another active state writer; it is reserved for a lock from a failed operation when automatic unlocking failed.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#m1"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking#tb2",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb3",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb4",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb5",
              "terraform.state_locking#tb6"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Contrast legitimate recovery of a failed operation’s leftover lock with bypassing an active writer. Contention is a reason to verify blocking, not disable locking.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "terraform.state_locking"
            ],
